        "original_id": "77ed3f25-518d-5cc9-b475-67b6a0d6b11c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Scott Grimes, Donald Malarkey, Steve Smith, Stan Smith\n- Productions: ER, Party of Five, Band of Brothers, American Dad!, I Am the Walrus\n- Roles: Dr. Archie Morris, Will McCorkle, Technical Sergeant Donald Malarkey\n\nFacts:\n- Scott Grimes had prominent roles as Dr. Archie Morris in ER, Will McCorkle in Party of Five, and Technical Sergeant Donald Malarkey in Band of Brothers.\n- Donald Malarkey was portrayed by Scott Grimes in the HBO miniseries Band of Brothers.\n- Scott Grimes voices Steve Smith in the animated sitcom American Dad!.\n- The American Dad! episode I Am the Walrus mainly centers on Stan Smith and his son Steve competing for the dominant role in the house.",
